WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.986
Hi, I'm Sarah from A9 Voice.

2
00:00:03.026 --> 00:00:04.723
Your notes pile up fast.

3
00:00:04.763 --> 00:00:07.328
Here's how to find anything in them.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.449
Press Control K and
type what you remember.

5
00:00:11.489 --> 00:00:14.389
Results show which note,
who said it, and when.

6
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.293
Click a result, and the note
opens right at that moment.

7
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.795
Or ask a question.

8
00:00:20.835 --> 00:00:24.246
It answers from your notes, and
shows you where it was said.

9
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.094
You can ask about the
meeting during a call,

10
00:00:30.134 --> 00:00:31.686
too, right in the Live window.

11
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:36.273
That's it.

12
00:00:36.313 --> 00:00:38.553
If it was said, you can find it.
